  "rulings": {
    "references": [],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "This Tamer will be able to attack in the same way as a Digimon, and will also receive effects that target Digimon. It will also be deleted in battles with Digimon or Security Digimon.",
        "question": "How does this card's [Start of Your Main Phase] effect treat this Tamer as a Digimon?",
        "reference": ""
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it will be deleted.",
        "question": "If the DP of this card, which is treated as a Digimon due to the [Start of Your Main Phase] effect, is reduced to 0 by an opponent's effect, will it be deleted?",
        "reference": ""
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, When this card's [Start of Your Main Phase] activates, this card is treated as both a Digimon and a Tamer, so when it is suspended, it is considered to meet the conditions \"When this Tamer is suspended\".",
        "question": "When this card, treated as a Digimon due to the [Start of Your Main Phase] effect, is suspended, this card's [Your Turn] effect of \"When this tamer is suspended\" activate because it's currently a Digimon?",
        "reference": ""
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, it does not. The effect of this card is only treated as a \"Digimon\", and when it is placed in the evolution source of another Digimon, it is treated as a Tamer card and the [Start of Your Main Phase] effect that was activated is lost.",
        "question": "If this card, which is treated as a Digimon due to the [Start of Your Main Phase] effect, is chosen for the effect of \"Place 1 Digimon as a digivolution card of another Digimon\". Does that count as \"digivolving from this Digimon\"?",
        "reference": ""
      }
    ]
  },
